    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "hx-w-full hx-overflow-x-hidden",
      "innerText": "What is the Xfinity 5-Year Price Guarantee? The Xfinity 5-Year Price Guarantee locks in your base monthly home internet rate for 60 months. You get one simple, consistent price with no annual contract required and the option to change or cancel your service at any time. Current plans also get you WiFi equipment and unlimited data included in that price. Plus if you move to a new address in our service area, your rate still stays the same. Is there a contract or early termination fee? No, there is no annual contract or early termination fee. You can cancel any time without a penalty. Are there hidden fees or extra charges? Our pricing is transparent so there will be no surprises on your bill. When you lock in our offers, it locks in your base monthly rate. Our latest internet plans include WiFi equipment and unlimited data in the cost, so you won't have surprise rental fees or data overages. How do I confirm I have the 5-Year Price Guarantee? You’ll find the 5-Year Price Guarantee discount reflected in your cart before completing your order, in your order confirmation, and on your bill. Can I change my plan? You can upgrade or switch your internet plan at any time without penalties or fees, however pricing may change depending on offers available at the time.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(20, 20, 23)",
      "headings": []
